1
00:00:00,194 --> 00:00:01,393
“Ishaan was saying

2
00:00:01,393 --> 00:00:02,741
something about you…”

3
00:00:02,741 --> 00:00:03,490
One line.

4
00:00:03,490 --> 00:00:05,337
Eight years of friendship.

5
00:00:05,379 --> 00:00:06,722
Varun told Ishaan

6
00:00:06,722 --> 00:00:07,890
the same line.

7
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:09,192
About Aarav.

8
00:00:09,233 --> 00:00:11,091
Aarav's thumb on Block.

9
00:00:11,091 --> 00:00:12,629
Then Kabir bhaiya:

10
00:00:12,629 --> 00:00:14,609
“Wait. Hear a story.”

11
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:15,932
A lion, Pingalaka,

12
00:00:15,932 --> 00:00:17,427
and a bull, Sanjivaka:

13
00:00:17,427 --> 00:00:18,745
close friends.

14
00:00:18,786 --> 00:00:20,145
The jackal Damanaka,

15
00:00:20,145 --> 00:00:21,243
left out of it,

16
00:00:21,243 --> 00:00:22,706
whispered to the lion:

17
00:00:22,706 --> 00:00:23,803
“The bull wants

18
00:00:23,803 --> 00:00:25,046
to kill you.”

19
00:00:25,087 --> 00:00:26,048
Then to the bull:

20
00:00:26,048 --> 00:00:26,925
“The lion wants

21
00:00:26,925 --> 00:00:27,968
to kill you.”

22
00:00:28,019 --> 00:00:29,893
Neither asked the other.

23
00:00:29,893 --> 00:00:31,891
And the lion attacked.

24
00:00:31,932 --> 00:00:32,888
When every word

25
00:00:32,888 --> 00:00:34,253
goes through the middle,

26
00:00:34,253 --> 00:00:35,164
the friendship

27
00:00:35,164 --> 00:00:36,415
is in his hands.

28
00:00:36,456 --> 00:00:37,562
The fix is simple:

29
00:00:37,562 --> 00:00:38,687
ask directly.

30
00:00:38,718 --> 00:00:39,646
Aarav typed:

31
00:00:39,646 --> 00:00:41,089
“Varun said something.

32
00:00:41,089 --> 00:00:42,473
I'm asking you.”

33
00:00:42,515 --> 00:00:43,195
The reply:

34
00:00:43,195 --> 00:00:44,344
“I said nothing, bro.

35
00:00:44,344 --> 00:00:45,025
I was told

36
00:00:45,025 --> 00:00:46,211
the same thing.”

37
00:00:46,252 --> 00:00:47,857
Book One's

38
00:00:47,857 --> 00:00:49,060
opening verse:

39
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:50,865
a growing friendship…

40
00:00:50,865 --> 00:00:52,202
destroyed by a

41
00:00:52,202 --> 00:00:54,056
slandering jackal.

42
00:00:54,097 --> 00:00:55,269
What would you do?

43
00:00:55,269 --> 00:00:56,196
Ask directly,

44
00:00:56,196 --> 00:00:57,800
or quietly drift away?

45
